geanyenv — per-project environment variables for Geany

Reads <project>/geany.env on project open and sets environment
variables for all spawned processes (treebrowser, file tools,
CLI terminals, AI agent).

Format:
  # comment
  JAVA_HOME=/opt/java/25
  MAVEN_HOME=/opt/maven/3.9
  PATH=${JAVA_HOME}/bin:${MAVEN_HOME}/bin:${PATH}

Variables restored on project close.
